('white-water-inn-dharamkot-road-mcleod-ganj', 'White Water Inn', 'hotel', 'published', 'directory', 'White Water Inn (listed on some sites as White Water Inn McLeodganj, and earlier as FabHotel White Water Inn) sits on Dharamkot Road right beside the Tibetan Institute of Performing Arts (TIPA), on the quieter, uphill side of McLeod Ganj. Booking sites put the Dalai Lama temple complex at about a 16 minute walk, and the main square at roughly 1.5 km, so it works for people who want to walk into town but sleep away from the bazaar noise.

Rooms are simple budget doubles, and some listings mention dorm-style beds. There is a terrace, a snack bar and restaurant, free Wi-Fi, a 24 hour front desk, laundry and luggage storage. Guests praise the views and the helpful staff. The common complaints are the steep steps from the road up to reception, which are hard with heavy bags or for anyone with limited mobility, and a restaurant that guests describe as basic. One listing says cash only, so carry cash.', 'A budget hotel on Dharamkot Road next to TIPA, with a terrace, a small restaurant and valley views, reached by a flight of steps from the road.', 'mcleod-ganj', 'Dharamkot Road, next to TIPA, McLeod Ganj', 'Dharamkot Road, next to TIPA, McLeod Ganj', 'McLeod Ganj', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["WiFi","Restaurant","Snack bar","Terrace","24-hour front desk","Laundry","Luggage storage","Mountain views"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"question":"Where is White Water Inn located?","answer":"White Water Inn is in Dharamkot Road, next to TIPA, McLeod Ganj. Nearby: TIPA (Tibetan Institute of Performing Arts) -- next door; Dalai Lama temple complex -- about 16 min walk."},{"question":"Who is White Water Inn best for?","answer":"It suits budget travellers, solo travellers, walkers heading to dharamkot and triund. See other stays in McLeod Ganj if you want a different style or budget."},{"question":"How do I check rates for White Water Inn?","answer":"Send an enquiry or WhatsApp us with your dates and number of guests. We check availability and rates for you, or suggest a similar stay in McLeod Ganj."}]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'budget', '["Next to TIPA on Dharamkot Road, on the quieter uphill side of McLeod Ganj","Terrace with valley views","Rated well for views and friendly staff on booking sites","Steep steps from the road to reception, so not ideal for limited mobility"]'::jsonb, '["Budget travellers","Solo travellers","Walkers heading to Dharamkot and Triund"]'::jsonb, '["TIPA (Tibetan Institute of Performing Arts) -- next door","Dalai Lama temple complex -- about 16 min walk","McLeod Ganj main square -- about 1.5 km"]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'Directory listing added Oct 2026. Verified operating via: https://www.justdial.com/Dharamshala/White-Water-Inn-Next-Tipa-Mcleod-Ganj/9999P1892-1892-190815175859-G2G6_BZDET , https://uk.trip.com/hotels/kangra-hotel-detail-48542520/white-water-inn-mcleodganj , https://ie.hotels.com/ho1183716768/white-water-inn-mcleodganj-dharamshala-india , https://en.planetofhotels.com/india/dharamshala/white-water-inn , https://www.trivago.in/en-IN/oar/hotel-white-water-inn-mcleodganj-dharamsala?search=100-14511120. No verified own photos yet -- page shows an area photo.', 0, 0, 0, NOW(), (SELECT id FROM profiles WHERE role = 'admin' ORDER BY created_at LIMIT 1)),
('hotel-malghotras-naddi-road-dal-lake', 'Hotel Malghotras by Hazel Hotels', 'hotel', 'published', 'directory', 'Hotel Malghotras, part of Hazel Hotels, stands on Naddi Road close to Dal Lake, a short drive above the main McLeod Ganj bazaar. It opened in 2019 and is rated as a three-star hotel. Trip.com lists it at about a 4 minute walk from Dal Lake and about 12 minutes from the Dalai Lama’s residence, and Dal Lake itself is about 2-3 km from the main square.

Rooms include Super Deluxe categories and a premium room with a balcony and mountain view, with a TV, fridge and minibar. There is a restaurant, a bar and lounge, parking and Wi-Fi, though some guests report the Wi-Fi is weak. A paid breakfast buffet runs roughly 9:00 to 10:30. Ratings differ a lot between sites (from about 3.2 to 4.9 out of 5 on different platforms), so ask for a mountain-view room when you enquire and check recent reviews before you commit.', 'A mid-range three-star hotel on Naddi Road near Dal Lake, with balcony rooms, a restaurant and bar-lounge, and parking, opened in 2019.', 'mcleod-ganj', 'Naddi Road, near Dal Lake, McLeod Ganj', 'Naddi Road, near Dal Lake, McLeod Ganj', 'McLeod Ganj', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["Restaurant","Bar and lounge","Parking","WiFi","Balcony rooms","TV","Refrigerator","Minibar","Mountain views"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"question":"Where is Hotel Malghotras by Hazel Hotels located?","answer":"Hotel Malghotras by Hazel Hotels is in Naddi Road, near Dal Lake, McLeod Ganj. Nearby: Dal Lake -- about 4 min walk; Dalai Lama’s residence -- about 12 min walk (per booking site)."},{"question":"Who is Hotel Malghotras by Hazel Hotels best for?","answer":"It suits couples, families wanting a hotel with parking, travellers who prefer a quieter base near dal lake. See other stays in McLeod Ganj if you want a different style or budget."},{"question":"How do I check rates for Hotel Malghotras by Hazel Hotels?","answer":"Send an enquiry or WhatsApp us with your dates and number of guests. We check availability and rates for you, or suggest a similar stay in McLeod Ganj."}]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'mid-range', '["Naddi Road location close to Dal Lake, away from the bazaar crowds","Premium rooms with balcony and mountain view","Restaurant, bar and lounge on site, with parking","Opened in 2019, so rooms are newer than many older hotels nearby"]'::jsonb, '["Couples","Families wanting a hotel with parking","Travellers who prefer a quieter base near Dal Lake"]'::jsonb, '["Dal Lake -- about 4 min walk","Dalai Lama’s residence -- about 12 min walk (per booking site)","McLeod Ganj main square -- about 2-3 km"]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'Directory listing added Oct 2026. Verified operating via: https://de.trip.com/hotels/kangra-hotel-detail-47399307/hotel-malghotras-by-hazel-hotels , https://www.goibibo.com/hotels/malghotras-by-hazel-hotels-hotel-in-dharamshala-6284099522287070339/ , https://www.justdial.com/Dharamshala/Hotel-Malghotras-By-Hazel-Hotels-Near-Dal-Lake-Dal-Lake/9999P1892-1892-241230233735-U8S7_BZDET , https://www.easemytrip.com/hotels/hotel-malghotras-by-hazel-hotels-1626335/ , https://www.adanione.com/india-hotels/hotel-malghotras-mcleod-ganj-dharamshala-3910862. No verified own photos yet -- page shows an area photo.', 0, 0, 0, NOW(), (SELECT id FROM profiles WHERE role = 'admin' ORDER BY created_at LIMIT 1)),
('treebo-ortus-residency-sheela-chowk-dharamshala', 'Treebo Ortus Residency', 'hotel', 'published', 'directory', 'Treebo Ortus Residency (also listed as Treebo Trend Ortus Residency) is in lower Dharamshala, not in McLeod Ganj. It is on Dharamshala Road near Hotel Club Mahindra at Sheela Chowk, in the Dari area, about 2.3 km from the HPCA cricket stadium and about 2.6 km from Norbulingka according to Hotels.com. McLeod Ganj is a separate trip uphill, roughly 7-10 km by road, so choose it for access to the lower town, the stadium and the Kangra side rather than for walking to the Dalai Lama temple.

It is a Treebo franchise three-star with Standard, Deluxe and Premium rooms (a Standard room is about 110 sq ft with a king bed). Facilities include a rooftop terrace, restaurant, coffee shop, Wi-Fi, parking, a 24 hour front desk and tour assistance. Guest reviews are mixed, so read recent ones. As a franchise, ownership and standards can change, so confirm details when you enquire.', 'A Treebo-branded three-star hotel at Sheela Chowk in lower Dharamshala, with a rooftop terrace, restaurant and coffee shop, handy for the cricket stadium and the road to McLeod Ganj.', 'dharamshala', 'Dharamshala Road near Hotel Club Mahindra, Sheela Chowk, Dari, lower Dharamshala', 'Dharamshala Road near Hotel Club Mahindra, Sheela Chowk, Dari, lower Dharamshala', 'Dharamshala', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["Rooftop terrace","Restaurant","Coffee shop","WiFi","Parking","24-hour front desk","Tour assistance"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"question":"Where is Treebo Ortus Residency located?","answer":"Treebo Ortus Residency is in Dharamshala Road near Hotel Club Mahindra, Sheela Chowk, Dari, lower Dharamshala. Nearby: HPCA Stadium -- about 2.3 km; Norbulingka Institute -- about 2.6 km."},{"question":"Who is Treebo Ortus Residency best for?","answer":"It suits cricket match visitors, business and transit stays in lower dharamshala, drivers who want parking. See other stays in Dharamshala if you want a different style or budget."},{"question":"How do I check rates for Treebo Ortus Residency?","answer":"Send an enquiry or WhatsApp us with your dates and number of guests. We check availability and rates for you, or suggest a similar stay in Dharamshala."}]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'mid-range', '["Lower Dharamshala location at Sheela Chowk, close to the cricket stadium side of town","Rooftop terrace, restaurant and coffee shop","Treebo-branded three-star with Standard, Deluxe and Premium rooms","Parking and a 24 hour front desk"]'::jsonb, '["Cricket match visitors","Business and transit stays in lower Dharamshala","Drivers who want parking"]'::jsonb, '["HPCA Stadium -- about 2.3 km","Norbulingka Institute -- about 2.6 km","McLeod Ganj main square -- roughly 7-10 km by road"]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'Directory listing added Oct 2026. Verified operating via: https://www.treebo.com/hotels-in-dharamshala/treebo-ortus-residency-sheela-chowk-2592/ , https://www.expedia.com/Dharamshala-Hotels-Treebo-Trend-Ortus-Residency.h67561089.Hotel-Information , https://in.hotels.com/ho2162954848/treebo-trend-ortus-residency-dharamshala-india/ , https://www.booking.com/hotel/in/treebo-trend-ortus-regency.html , https://www.goibibo.com/hotels/treebo-ortus-residency-hotel-in-dharamshala-623778094846310038/. No verified own photos yet -- page shows an area photo.', 0, 0, 0, NOW(), (SELECT id FROM profiles WHERE role = 'admin' ORDER BY created_at LIMIT 1)),
('treebo-roshan-house-valley-view-naddi', 'Treebo Roshan House With Valley View', 'hotel', 'published', 'directory', 'Roshan House (listed as Treebo Roshan House With Valley View, and sometimes Treebo Trend Roshan House) is on Dal Lake Road in Naddi, between the St John in the Wilderness church and the Naddi viewpoint. It is a quiet spot. One guest describes about a 20 minute walk to town, and the main McLeod Ganj square is roughly 2-3 km away, so most people use a taxi or auto for the uphill return.

The hotel is a Treebo-branded three-star with a valley-facing outlook and balconies in some rooms. There is a restaurant serving Indian food, a vegetarian breakfast, free Wi-Fi, free parking and a 24 hour front desk. Guests praise the staff and the food. One review mentions getting a different room from the one booked, so confirm the room type in writing, especially if you want a balcony or valley view.', 'A quiet Treebo-branded hotel on Dal Lake Road in Naddi, with valley views, balconies in some rooms, an Indian restaurant and free parking.', 'naddi', 'Dal Lake Road, Naddi, between St John in the Wilderness church and Naddi viewpoint', 'Dal Lake Road, Naddi, between St John in the Wilderness church and Naddi viewpoint', 'Naddi', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["Restaurant","Vegetarian breakfast","WiFi","Free parking","24-hour front desk","Balcony rooms","Valley views"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"question":"Where is Treebo Roshan House With Valley View located?","answer":"Treebo Roshan House With Valley View is in Dal Lake Road, Naddi, between St John in the Wilderness church and Naddi viewpoint. Nearby: Naddi viewpoint -- close by on the same road; St John in the Wilderness church -- close by."},{"question":"Who is Treebo Roshan House With Valley View best for?","answer":"It suits couples wanting quiet, families with a car, sunset and naddi viewpoint seekers. See other stays in Naddi if you want a different style or budget."},{"question":"How do I check rates for Treebo Roshan House With Valley View?","answer":"Send an enquiry or WhatsApp us with your dates and number of guests. We check availability and rates for you, or suggest a similar stay in Naddi."}]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'budget', '["Quiet Naddi location on Dal Lake Road, away from the bazaar","Valley views, with balconies in some rooms","Indian restaurant and vegetarian breakfast","Free parking and free Wi-Fi"]'::jsonb, '["Couples wanting quiet","Families with a car","Sunset and Naddi viewpoint seekers"]'::jsonb, '["Naddi viewpoint -- close by on the same road","St John in the Wilderness church -- close by","McLeod Ganj main square -- about 2-3 km"]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'Directory listing added Oct 2026. Verified operating via: https://www.kayak.co.in/Dharamsala-Hotels-Treebo-Trend-Roshan-House.2932731.ksp , https://www.wego.co.in/hotels/india/dharamshala/treebo-trend-roshan-house-1705292 , https://www.makemytrip.com/hotels/treebo_roshan_house_with_valley_view-details-dharamshala.html , https://www.ixigo.com/hotels/treebo-roshan-house-with-valley-view-in-jangal-reserve-banoi-1269407-d , https://wanderlog.com/place/details/1813575/treebo-roshan-house. No verified own photos yet -- page shows an area photo.', 0, 0, 0, NOW(), (SELECT id FROM profiles WHERE role = 'admin' ORDER BY created_at LIMIT 1)),
('the-lodge-dharamkot-studio-road', 'The Lodge Dharamkot', 'hotel', 'published', 'directory', 'The Lodge in Dharamkot (listed on booking sites as WOW STAYZ2 The Lodge, WOWSTAYZ The Lodge or The Lodge by Cyber Tatva) is on Dharamkot Studio Road, near Hotel Cloud Chat. Listings give about 5 to 11 minutes on foot to Tushita Meditation Centre, which makes it a practical base for retreats, courses and the walk up towards Triund. Dharamkot is a village above McLeod Ganj, so for the main square allow roughly 2-3 km, mostly uphill on the way back.

Room types include a Deluxe Room with Balcony and a Cottage with Kitchen and Balcony; some rooms have a kitchenette or AC. The lobby has a fireplace, and there is a rooftop terrace, a restaurant and Wi-Fi. Breakfast is extra and there is no room service. Guest scores are good on small samples, but Google reviews are mixed on service, so confirm what is included. This is not the same as other places called The Lodge in Dharamshala.', 'A budget lodge on Dharamkot Studio Road with balcony rooms, cottages with kitchens, a fireplace lobby, a rooftop terrace and a short walk to Tushita Meditation Centre.', 'dharamkot', 'Dharamkot Studio Road, near Hotel Cloud Chat, Dharamkot', 'Dharamkot Studio Road, near Hotel Cloud Chat, Dharamkot', 'Dharamkot', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["Restaurant","Rooftop terrace","Fireplace lobby","WiFi","Balcony rooms","Kitchenette in some rooms","Cottages with kitchen"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"question":"Where is The Lodge Dharamkot located?","answer":"The Lodge Dharamkot is in Dharamkot Studio Road, near Hotel Cloud Chat, Dharamkot. Nearby: Tushita Meditation Centre -- about 5-11 min walk; Hotel Cloud Chat -- next to the lodge."},{"question":"Who is The Lodge Dharamkot best for?","answer":"It suits retreat and course attendees, long-stay travellers, walkers heading for triund. See other stays in Dharamkot if you want a different style or budget."},{"question":"How do I check rates for The Lodge Dharamkot?","answer":"Send an enquiry or WhatsApp us with your dates and number of guests. We check availability and rates for you, or suggest a similar stay in Dharamkot."}]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'budget', '["Short walk from Tushita Meditation Centre in Dharamkot","Cottages with a kitchen for longer stays","Fireplace lobby and rooftop terrace","Balcony rooms; breakfast extra, no room service"]'::jsonb, '["Retreat and course attendees","Long-stay travellers","Walkers heading for Triund"]'::jsonb, '["Tushita Meditation Centre -- about 5-11 min walk","Hotel Cloud Chat -- next to the lodge","McLeod Ganj main square -- about 2-3 km"]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'Directory listing added Oct 2026. Verified operating via: https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g4262918-d6966235-Reviews-WOW_STAYZ2_The_Lodge-Dharamkot_Dharamsala_Kangra_District_Himachal_Pradesh.html , https://www.makemytrip.com/hotels/wowstayz_the_lodge-details-dharamshala.html , https://www.adanione.com/india-hotels/wow-stayz2-the-lodge-dharamkot-dharamshala-742822 , https://www.expedia.co.kr/en/Dharamshala-Hotels-The-Lodge.h34746363.Hotel-Information. No verified own photos yet -- page shows an area photo.', 0, 0, 0, NOW(), (SELECT id FROM profiles WHERE role = 'admin' ORDER BY created_at LIMIT 1)),
('hotel-mount-edge-naddi-road', 'Hotel Mount Edge', 'hotel', 'published', 'directory', 'Hotel Mount Edge, also listed as FabHotel Mount Edge, is on Naddi Road in Naddi village, in the Dal Lake area above McLeod Ganj. The main McLeod Ganj square is roughly 2-3 km away, so most guests take a short taxi ride into town.

It is a no-frills budget hotel with attached washrooms, Wi-Fi, a 24 hour front desk, parking, a terrace and a restaurant. Ratings on booking sites are decent but come from small samples. One booking site notes cash only with ID and a card at check-in, so ask before you arrive how you can pay.', 'A small budget hotel on Naddi Road near Dal Lake (earlier listed as FabHotel Mount Edge), with attached bathrooms, a terrace, a restaurant and parking.', 'naddi', 'Naddi Road, Village Naddi, near Dal Lake', 'Naddi Road, Village Naddi, near Dal Lake', 'Naddi', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["WiFi","Restaurant","Terrace","Parking","24-hour front desk","Attached washroom"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"question":"Where is Hotel Mount Edge located?","answer":"Hotel Mount Edge is in Naddi Road, Village Naddi, near Dal Lake. Nearby: Dal Lake -- close by on Naddi Road; Naddi viewpoint -- close by."},{"question":"Who is Hotel Mount Edge best for?","answer":"It suits budget travellers, couples, drivers who want parking. See other stays in Naddi if you want a different style or budget."},{"question":"How do I check rates for Hotel Mount Edge?","answer":"Send an enquiry or WhatsApp us with your dates and number of guests. We check availability and rates for you, or suggest a similar stay in Naddi."}]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'budget', '["Naddi Road base near Dal Lake and the Naddi viewpoint","Attached washrooms, Wi-Fi and 24 hour front desk","Terrace and on-site restaurant","Budget stay with parking"]'::jsonb, '["Budget travellers","Couples","Drivers who want parking"]'::jsonb, '["Dal Lake -- close by on Naddi Road","Naddi viewpoint -- close by","McLeod Ganj main square -- about 2-3 km"]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'Directory listing added Oct 2026. Verified operating via: https://www.adanione.com/india-hotels/hotel-mount-edge-mcleod-ganj-dharamshala-2885282 , https://www.booking.com/hotel/in/sanskriti-dharamshala12.html , https://www.goibibo.com/hotels/mount-edge-hotel-in-dharamshala-8491904997264124262/ , https://en.planetofhotels.com/india/dharamshala/hotel-mount-edge , https://in.hotels.com/ho1182772544/hotel-mount-edge-dharamshala-india , https://www.makemytrip.global/hotels/hotel_mount_edge-details-dharamshala.html. No verified own photos yet -- page shows an area photo.', 0, 0, 0, NOW(), (SELECT id FROM profiles WHERE role = 'admin' ORDER BY created_at LIMIT 1))
